{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Yams\/documentation\/Yams\/AliasDereferencingStrategy\/Value","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":" = any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Decodable","preciseIdentifier":"s:Se"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yams\/aliasdereferencingstrategy\/value"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The stored exestential type of all AliasDereferencingStrategys","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yams\/documentation\/Yams","doc:\/\/Yams\/documentation\/Yams\/AliasDereferencingStrategy"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"title":"AliasDereferencingStrategy.Value","roleHeading":"Type Alias","externalID":"s:4Yams26AliasDereferencingStrategyP5Valuea","symbolKind":"typealias","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Value","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Yams"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Value"}],"role":"symbol"},"references":{"doc://Yams/documentation/Yams/AliasDereferencingStrategy/Value":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yams\/documentation\/Yams\/AliasDereferencingStrategy\/Value","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"typealias"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Value"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"AliasDereferencingStrategy.Value","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The stored exestential type of all AliasDereferencingStrategys","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Value"}],"url":"\/documentation\/yams\/aliasdereferencingstrategy\/value"},"doc://Yams/documentation/Yams":{"url":"\/documentation\/yams","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yams\/documentation\/Yams","role":"collection","title":"Yams","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Yams/documentation/Yams/AliasDereferencingStrategy":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class-bound protocol which implements a strategy for dereferencing aliases (or dealiasing) values during"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"YAML document decoding. YAML documents which do not contain anchors will not benefit from the use of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an AliasDereferencingStrategy in any way. The main use-case for dereferencing aliases in a YML document"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is when decoding into class types. If the yaml document is large and contains many references"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(perhaps it is a representation of a dense graph) then, decoding into structs will require the of large amounts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of system memory to represent highly redundant (duplicated) data structures."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, if the same document is decoded into class types and the decoding uses"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AliasDereferencingStrategy"},{"text":" such as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BasicAliasDereferencingStrategy"},{"text":" then the emitted value will have its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"class references coalesced. No duplicate objects will be initialized (unless identical objects have multiple","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"distinct anchors in the YAML document). In some scenarios this may significantly reduce the memory footprint of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the decoded type.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AliasDereferencingStrategy"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AliasDereferencingStrategy"}],"url":"\/documentation\/yams\/aliasdereferencingstrategy","title":"AliasDereferencingStrategy","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yams\/documentation\/Yams\/AliasDereferencingStrategy"}}}